data: {"id": "74b85551dd334dcc-thinking-parallel_evidence-706", "run_id": "74b85551dd334dcc", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实与结论\n\n### 直接证据\n1. **Pod YAML 确认真实存在且处于 Terminating**\n   - `deletionTimestamp: 2026-09-03T22:31:03Z`（距今约 52 分钟）\n   - `deletionGracePeriodSeconds: 0`（立即终止策略）\n   - **`finalizers: [\"aiops.lab/hold\"]`** — 这是 Terminating 卡住的根因。Pod 的 finalizer 自定义控制器未完成清理，导致 API Server 无法删除该对象。\n   - `phase: Running`（Kubernetes 中 Terminating Pod 的 phase 仍为 Running，这是正常行为）\n   - `containers[app]: ready=False, reason=Error, exitCode=137`（OOM Kill 导致容器退出）\n\n2. **Events 单一事件**\n   - 仅有一条 `Normal Killing` 事件，确认 kubelet 曾", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788477823239, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

